1
00:01:37,590 --> 00:01:42,979
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:46,009 --> 00:01:48,530
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

4
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,280
Master.

5
00:02:04,350 --> 00:02:06,350
Please save Zhengjun.

6
00:02:07,070 --> 00:02:08,190
Concubine Mei.

7
00:02:08,669 --> 00:02:10,990
[Jingmu Hall]

8
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:11,150
You failed to raise your son properly
and indulged him

9
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:14,630
to the point where he made such a grave mistake
that implicated the whole family.

10
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:17,230
How do you still have the nerve
to plead for him?

11
00:02:22,470 --> 00:02:23,630
Master.

12
00:02:25,070 --> 00:02:27,130
We haven't seen each other for years.

13
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:31,470
Zhengjun and I have been missing you
day and night.

14
00:02:31,470 --> 00:02:34,590
Zhengjun is your own flesh and blood!

15
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:37,840
If anything happens to him,

16
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,400
I won't be able to live either!

17
00:02:43,310 --> 00:02:45,280
Master!

18
00:03:24,170 --> 00:03:26,540
[Xie Shu, Army Inspector of the Northern Frontier,
Right Senior Attendant]

19
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,560
You are...

20
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,750
Father.

21
00:03:36,710 --> 00:03:37,800
I am Qingyuan.

22
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:54,710
Being urged along,
with little time to bathe and groom.

23
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,750
Mother!

24
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:13,030
Chunqing.

25
00:04:16,510 --> 00:04:18,310
There's no turning back for me.

26
00:04:20,390 --> 00:04:21,320
In the next life,

27
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,730
let's keep being husband and wife.

28
00:04:41,750 --> 00:04:42,560
Alike.

29
00:04:44,150 --> 00:04:45,240
Too alike.

30
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,810
You look so much like your mother.

31
00:04:57,830 --> 00:04:58,720
Father!

32
00:04:59,310 --> 00:05:00,040
Father!

33
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:01,680
Father!

34
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:04,000
You're finally back!

35
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,260
Did you bring me a gift?

36
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,270
Father,

37
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:08,000
do our new clothes look nice?

38
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:08,750
Yes.

39
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,040
You've grown taller.

40
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,630
-Jingzhi.
-You look prettier.

41
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:12,830
-Mother.
-Thank you, father.

42
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:14,290
-Mother is here!
-Mother.

43
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:17,440
Greetings, Master.

44
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,360
Madam,

45
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:21,670
thank you for your hard work.

46
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,040
Father,

47
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:23,950
you said

48
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:26,720
you'd buy me a kite
as soon as you came back.

49
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:29,000
How old are you?

50
00:05:36,150 --> 00:05:37,720
Finally, you're back,

51
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,600
murderer.

52
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,360
Mother,

53
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,830
I've been away for many years

54
00:05:45,830 --> 00:05:47,150
and couldn't fulfill my filial duties.

55
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:48,270
When you were sick,

56
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,220
I couldn't rush back to serve you.

57
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,830
I have failed as a son.

58
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:54,130
Please forgive me.

59
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,070
Shu,

60
00:05:58,190 --> 00:05:59,310
get up, quickly.

61
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:01,950
My son,

62
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:03,920
look at you.

63
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,240
Why are you so haggard?

64
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,820
Even if you were busy
with military affairs,

65
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:13,650
you should have
taken good care of yourself.

66
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:15,360
I heard

67
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:18,240
your back injury flared up again.

68
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:20,040
Are you feeling better now?

69
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,380
I've been fine for a long time.

70
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,360
Good.

71
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:26,120
Good then.

72
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,540
Where is Zhenglun?

73
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:32,000
That boy has some...

74
00:06:32,150 --> 00:06:33,120
trivial things to take care of.

75
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,240
He'll be back later.

76
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,120
Don't worry.

77
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,240
Father,

78
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,310
you haven't answered my question yet.

79
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:41,310
What gift did you bring me this time?

80
00:06:41,390 --> 00:06:42,750
You are a big girl now,

81
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:44,630
and you are still
asking your father for gifts?

82
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:45,560
There are gifts.

83
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,720
I have gifts for all of you.

84
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:50,280
All these years while I was away,

85
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,600
if you've made progress,

86
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:55,060
I have plenty of nice rewards for you.

87
00:06:56,190 --> 00:06:57,560
But for those

88
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,720
who have been naughty, like you,

89
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,520
I've prepared a big punishment.

90
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:03,720
She deserves a beating.

91
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:16,270
During the time you were away,

92
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,070
Lady Prefect

93
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:20,070
helped our residence

94
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,000
make a great match.

95
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,360
She betrothed Qinghe

96
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,870
to

97
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:28,600
the legitimate son of the Founding Count.

98
00:07:28,950 --> 00:07:31,560
This is an excellent match.

99
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,720
May our ancestors bless us.

100
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,150
In the future,

101
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:38,750
if all the younger generation
in our family

102
00:07:39,070 --> 00:07:40,830
make something of themselves,

103
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:42,720
when I go to the underworld,

104
00:07:42,870 --> 00:07:45,120
I'll be able to answer to your father.

105
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:47,240
Mother,

106
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:49,270
what are you saying?

107
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,600
I know about these things.

108
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,250
Have you forgotten?

109
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:54,770
I received your letter

110
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:56,310
a long time ago.

111
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,480
It's just that

112
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,830
I came back

113
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,440
before my reply arrived.

114
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:07,230
During the years I've been away,

115
00:08:07,430 --> 00:08:09,000
our residence has been well managed

116
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,560
thanks to Madam Hu.

117
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:13,070
She has led everyone
with tireless devotion,

118
00:08:13,070 --> 00:08:14,310
lived frugally,

119
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,720
shown filial devotion,

120
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,040
upheld her duties as a wife,

121
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:23,240
and kept the entire household
running like clockwork.

122
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,430
Honey,

123
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,870
thank you for your hard work.

124
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,480
Concubine Lian.

125
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,530
You have been gentle and kind,

126
00:08:38,750 --> 00:08:40,870
kept harmony throughout the household,

127
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:41,840
and always

128
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:46,270
put the interests of the Xie family first.

129
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,080
This marriage

130
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,600
is a great match.

131
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,240
Qinghe.

132
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:01,030
Are you satisfied with your marriage?

133
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,200
Son,

134
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:09,270
I believe you are aware of

135
00:09:09,790 --> 00:09:13,790
why Yan Rui surrounded our residence.

136
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,870
Our family was

137
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,600
extremely careful,

138
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:20,630
but we still fell into his trap.

139
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,360
Yan Rui

140
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,790
is just a brat,

141
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:28,890
not worth mentioning.

142
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,200
Don't worry, Mother.

143
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:33,630
Lord Yan has arrived!

144
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:41,080
He came so quickly.

145
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,550
Lord Xie.

146
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:17,950
In all these years at the Xie Residence,

147
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,000
you are the first one

148
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:22,240
to barge into the hall

149
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,720
uninvited.

150
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,670
You must be...

151
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,120
Lord Yan.

152
00:10:31,670 --> 00:10:32,750
I am.

153
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,550
Nice to meet you.

154
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,150
Lord Xie, you are a busy man.

155
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,200
Today,

156
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,410
we finally have the chance to meet.

157
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:47,870
Lord Yan,

158
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:51,390
you concern yourself with everything,

159
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:53,510
from matters of state to civil affairs.

160
00:10:53,510 --> 00:10:54,770
I didn't expect myself

161
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,480
to be on your list of concerns as well.

162
00:10:58,030 --> 00:10:59,870
You sure do work hard.

163
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:01,910
Thank you.

164
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,910
Lord Yan,

165
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:06,080
my son just arrived,

166
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:08,150
and you already got the news.

167
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:12,390
You really have eyes everywhere.

168
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:16,220
Thank you for the compliment, Old Madam.

169
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,840
Lord Xie

170
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:21,090
is an important minister of the court

171
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,930
with heavy responsibilities.

172
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,030
I should naturally care about him.

173
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,510
I heard my son

174
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:33,600
is involved in

175
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:38,360
some case regarding disaster relief grain.

176
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:41,150
Is the evidence complete now?

177
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:42,910
Rest assured, Lord Xie.

178
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:45,720
I will handle it impartially.

179
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:46,750
Yes.

180
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:49,040
It must be handled impartially.

181
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:56,720
Then may I see my son?

182
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:57,670
Of course.

183
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,720
Whenever you want to see him,

184
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,960
you may see him.

185
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,550
I will be waiting for you.

186
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,840
Lord Yan, you're merciful.

187
00:12:07,150 --> 00:12:07,790
Thank you.

188
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,960
What are you laughing about?

189
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:19,000
The unpredictability of the world.

190
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,480
Do you remember

191
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:24,670
when I said we have a long future ahead?

192
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,120
My Lord.

193
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,360
Must you

194
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,480
continue this act?

195
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,150
With an honored guest here,

196
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:34,600
I naturally must continue.

197
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,150
What?

198
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,510
Your iron will

199
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,120
has finally softened,

200
00:12:39,390 --> 00:12:41,050
and you've changed your mind?

201
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,390
See?

202
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,510
What I can give you

203
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,500
is much more than this.

204
00:12:58,670 --> 00:13:00,080
My Lord, what I want

205
00:13:00,870 --> 00:13:02,400
is also much more than this.

206
00:13:07,380 --> 00:13:11,320
♪ I counted every moment ♪

207
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:09,510
I hope that this time,

208
00:13:10,630 --> 00:13:11,910
you mean it.

209
00:13:11,340 --> 00:13:15,430
♪ Memories took root ♪

210
00:13:15,450 --> 00:13:19,970
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

211
00:13:16,910 --> 00:13:17,870
The same to you.

212
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:24,570
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

213
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,240
I also hope that

214
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,670
you mean it.

215
00:13:25,090 --> 00:13:28,930
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

216
00:13:28,510 --> 00:13:29,840
Compared to East Pearls,

217
00:13:28,950 --> 00:13:33,160
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

218
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:31,910
it seems you prefer jade.

219
00:13:33,180 --> 00:13:39,610
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

220
00:13:40,090 --> 00:13:43,710
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

221
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:43,530
Allow me to kindly remind you.

222
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:49,250
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

223
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:49,000
Once hands holding a knife
are stained with blood,

224
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,390
they can never be washed clean.

225
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:53,840
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

226
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:58,040
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

227
00:13:58,070 --> 00:14:02,640
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

228
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:02,440
As long as my blade has a target,

229
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:07,000
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

230
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:05,010
even a mountain of corpses

231
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:11,390
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

232
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,480
and a sea of blood

233
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:11,030
mean nothing to me.

234
00:14:11,420 --> 00:14:15,820
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

235
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:21,630
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

236
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:41,600
Father, save me! Father!

237
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,000
I don't know anything, Father!

238
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,270
My Lord. My Lord. My Lord.

239
00:14:45,270 --> 00:14:46,200
My Lord. My Lord.

240
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,080
My Lord!

241
00:14:48,390 --> 00:14:49,360
You animal!

242
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:51,370
My Lord!

243
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:53,630
How dare you lay a hand
on the relief grain?

244
00:14:53,630 --> 00:14:55,030
Who did you collude with?

245
00:14:55,270 --> 00:14:56,390
How much did you embezzle?

246
00:14:56,390 --> 00:14:58,000
Tell me everything!

247
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:58,550
Father!

248
00:14:58,750 --> 00:15:00,550
I didn't know it was the relief grain!

249
00:15:00,550 --> 00:15:02,440
Guo Baofeng asked me
to transport the grain,

250
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:03,390
saying it could make money.

251
00:15:03,390 --> 00:15:05,450
If I had known it was the relief grain,

252
00:15:05,510 --> 00:15:07,240
I definitely wouldn't have dared to do it!

253
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,840
Father, please trust me!

254
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:09,910
Nonsense!

255
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:11,910
Trust me!

256
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:12,480
My Lord!

257
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:14,200
Leave me alone!

258
00:15:14,870 --> 00:15:16,130
None of you interfere.

259
00:15:16,510 --> 00:15:18,120
Before asking any questions,

260
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,180
torture him first.

261
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:20,720
Bring the whip!

262
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:21,440
Whip him!

263
00:15:21,550 --> 00:15:22,360
Father!

264
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,060
That's enough.

265
00:15:32,270 --> 00:15:33,000
Stop.

266
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:34,510
No.

267
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:36,480
Don't stop until he

268
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:38,130
gets 70 lashes!

269
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,360
Father!

270
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,580
If a prince breaks the law,

271
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,850
he is punished like a commoner.

272
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:49,200
-If this brat really did all this,
-Father!

273
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,750
I will kill him myself!

274
00:15:55,150 --> 00:15:56,010
That's enough.

275
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,030
Stop.

276
00:16:02,630 --> 00:16:04,430
Then I will be straightforward.

277
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:08,150
I believe your son is innocent.

278
00:16:08,790 --> 00:16:11,250
However, I really don't know
how to deal with

279
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:13,040
the mastermind behind this.

280
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:14,360
As you know,

281
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:18,240
I've been looking for the ledger
from the corruption case.

282
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,600
And I believe it's now

283
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:22,630
in your residence.

284
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:27,110
After all, it involves too many people,

285
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,910
including the Xie family.

286
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,280
It's a tricky matter.

287
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,720
Lord Yan,

288
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:36,790
you must not bend the law

289
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,720
out of consideration for me.

290
00:16:38,870 --> 00:16:39,910
If it is proven

291
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:43,150
that it really was my son's doing,

292
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:47,320
you must deal with him severely
according to the law.

293
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:51,090
I'm handing over
the entire Xie household to you,

294
00:16:51,670 --> 00:16:53,330
and I will have no complaints.

295
00:16:56,790 --> 00:16:57,630
Lord Xie,

296
00:16:58,510 --> 00:17:00,270
as you can see,

297
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,910
Wei Changyan supervises Hengtang

298
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:06,200
and has been entrenched here
for a long time.

299
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,800
Although this time,
I came by imperial decree,

300
00:17:09,030 --> 00:17:12,109
it is inconvenient for me
to deal with a local tyrant.

301
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:14,520
But Lord Xie, you are different.

302
00:17:14,790 --> 00:17:17,829
The Xie family
is a prestigious family in Hengtang

303
00:17:18,109 --> 00:17:19,770
with extensive connections.

304
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,109
I believe only you

305
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:23,010
can help me with this favor.

306
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:24,400
My Lord,

307
00:17:25,030 --> 00:17:25,960
think about it.

308
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:34,510
After all, if I don't catch the culprit,

309
00:17:34,830 --> 00:17:37,240
I can't release your son either.

310
00:17:38,110 --> 00:17:39,160
Say no more.

311
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,070
I understand.

312
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:44,480
Wei Changyan

313
00:17:45,110 --> 00:17:46,750
is indeed a tricky one.

314
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:49,060
But please do not worry, Lord Yan.

315
00:17:49,350 --> 00:17:51,550
No matter how complicated the world is,

316
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:53,830
nothing can ever override justice.

317
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:56,370
If a person commits evil deeds,

318
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,550
no matter how powerful

319
00:17:58,750 --> 00:18:00,270
or well-connected they are,

320
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:02,550
I only believe in one principle—

321
00:18:03,110 --> 00:18:05,310
good and evil will always be rewarded.

322
00:18:06,070 --> 00:18:06,960
Ultimately,

323
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:09,370
evil can never prevail over good.

324
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,480
Father.

325
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:45,090
What's the matter?

326
00:18:46,790 --> 00:18:49,200
I want to talk to you, Father.

327
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:03,200
What are you looking at, Father?

328
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,750
When I first saw you,

329
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:10,270
I thought you looked like your mother.

330
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:11,930
But now, the more I look at you,

331
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:16,000
the more I think you look like me.

332
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:24,680
The past is unbearable to recall.

333
00:19:27,070 --> 00:19:28,070
It is only natural

334
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:31,330
for a daughter to look like her father.

335
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:36,140
I just want to ask you, Father,

336
00:19:36,830 --> 00:19:39,510
what kind of person was my mother?

337
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:46,830
You were with your mother since childhood.

338
00:19:49,310 --> 00:19:51,310
You should know her better than I do.

339
00:19:53,590 --> 00:19:55,000
Why are you asking me?

340
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,550
When I was young,

341
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:04,700
I once fell seriously ill,

342
00:20:04,790 --> 00:20:06,320
with a high fever for 7 days.

343
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:07,880
After I woke up,

344
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:10,340
I couldn't remember many things.

345
00:20:11,110 --> 00:20:12,920
Even what my mother looked like

346
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,310
is a bit blurry.

347
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:19,550
When did you get sick?

348
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:24,660
How could it be so serious?

349
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:34,440
It must have been...

350
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:37,670
after I parted with my mother
for the last time.

351
00:20:38,750 --> 00:20:40,400
I don't remember clearly.

352
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,010
Whenever I try to recall it,

353
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:46,160
my head aches.

354
00:20:50,270 --> 00:20:51,070
Father,

355
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:53,590
I am unfilial.

356
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:55,200
I let Mother down.

357
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:57,400
So I hope you don't mind me asking

358
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,330
what kind of person

359
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,240
my mother was.

360
00:21:16,270 --> 00:21:17,310
Good child.

361
00:21:24,830 --> 00:21:25,790
Come with me.

362
00:21:44,750 --> 00:21:48,010
It was around the time
of the first spring thunder that year

363
00:21:49,590 --> 00:21:52,750
that I first saw your mother
at an entertainment house in Lin'an.

364
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:54,810
She was singing The Story of the Lute.

365
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,840
Her long sleeves fluttered,

366
00:21:57,160 --> 00:21:58,640
just like a butterfly.

367
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,830
She laughed
at Cai Bojie's foolish filial piety,

368
00:22:01,830 --> 00:22:04,200
abandoning his newly-wedded wife
for an official position.

369
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:07,480
But when I was studying for
the imperial examination, she advised me,

370
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:10,110
"An official position
is the most important thing to you.

371
00:22:10,110 --> 00:22:13,350
You must not let me
hold you back from your future.

372
00:22:14,790 --> 00:22:16,030
Through severe winters and hot summers,

373
00:22:16,030 --> 00:22:17,400
even if the seas run dry
and the rocks crumble,

374
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:18,460
I will wait for you.

375
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,700
Wait for you to come home."

376
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:24,920
Later, I thought of many ways.

377
00:22:26,590 --> 00:22:28,510
That Fifth Madam of yours

378
00:22:29,110 --> 00:22:32,720
was the niece
of Eunuch Xia in the capital.

379
00:22:32,600 --> 00:22:34,820
[Jingmu Hall]

380
00:22:33,030 --> 00:22:34,900
They are of great power.

381
00:22:35,590 --> 00:22:37,440
The Xia family gave the word

382
00:22:37,750 --> 00:22:39,280
to have your mother killed.

383
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:43,410
If I hadn't let your mother
leave the residence,

384
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:45,990
we wouldn't have been able
to save her life.

385
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:49,240
But if I had known

386
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:53,170
that your mother
was carrying my flesh and blood,

387
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,720
I would have fought for her
no matter what,

388
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:56,830
just as I fought

389
00:22:57,270 --> 00:23:00,350
to marry her back then.

390
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,160
Father,

391
00:23:13,590 --> 00:23:14,850
was this the first time

392
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:17,480
you fought for a woman?

393
00:23:19,830 --> 00:23:20,550
Of course.

394
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,400
It was also the last time.

395
00:23:24,270 --> 00:23:25,350
The only time.

396
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:33,440
The waters run deep
in the households of the powerful.

397
00:23:34,270 --> 00:23:35,270
In the Xie family,

398
00:23:35,790 --> 00:23:38,030
my marriages
to my wife and my 4 concubines

399
00:23:38,030 --> 00:23:40,000
were all alliances forged

400
00:23:40,310 --> 00:23:41,590
for power, influence,

401
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:43,750
or wealth.

402
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:45,830
The only one

403
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:48,310
I truly considered my wife

404
00:23:52,850 --> 00:23:54,110
[Danyue Pavilion]

405
00:23:57,550 --> 00:23:59,080
was your mother, Chunqing.

406
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:04,720
Chunqing...

407
00:24:06,350 --> 00:24:08,160
There's no turning back for me.

408
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,610
In the next life,

409
00:24:11,550 --> 00:24:13,480
let's keep being husband and wife.

410
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,240
Do you,

411
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:26,590
like everyone else,

412
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,110
think my mother

413
00:24:29,830 --> 00:24:30,960
was a murderer,

414
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,790
and that's why

415
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:35,440
you never cared about the two of us?

416
00:24:36,030 --> 00:24:37,240
How is that possible?

417
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:43,110
But the evidence was conclusive,

418
00:24:43,550 --> 00:24:45,480
and Cui'er testified against her.

419
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:47,540
I couldn't say I don't believe it.

420
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:51,160
I never visited you two

421
00:24:52,270 --> 00:24:53,200
for fear that

422
00:24:53,510 --> 00:24:55,400
any clues

423
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:57,030
would be discovered,

424
00:24:57,270 --> 00:24:58,930
which would bring harm to you.

425
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:00,960
Later,

426
00:25:01,110 --> 00:25:02,400
when that thing happened to your mother,

427
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:05,260
I searched all over Jiangnan
but couldn't find you.

428
00:25:05,550 --> 00:25:07,110
I didn't expect you

429
00:25:07,550 --> 00:25:09,080
to be in Hengtang all along.

430
00:25:12,350 --> 00:25:13,160
My daughter,

431
00:25:14,070 --> 00:25:15,400
you have suffered a lot.

432
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,750
I will show you something.

433
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:29,890
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

434
00:25:29,910 --> 00:25:32,090
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

435
00:25:30,590 --> 00:25:31,640
That year,

436
00:25:32,790 --> 00:25:35,450
I went to the capital
to take up my official post.

437
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:37,720
Before I left,

438
00:25:38,270 --> 00:25:40,510
your mother and I
lived in perfect harmony,

439
00:25:40,510 --> 00:25:42,240
and composed poetry together.

440
00:25:43,070 --> 00:25:45,000
This is what we wrote together.

441
00:25:46,070 --> 00:25:47,780
The words "Spring of The Blade"

442
00:25:47,780 --> 00:25:49,640
[Spring of The Blade]

443
00:25:48,350 --> 00:25:50,680
were written by your mother Chunqing.

444
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,350
Great!

445
00:25:56,450 --> 00:25:57,370
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

446
00:25:57,400 --> 00:25:58,560
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

447
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:02,440
I took my official post

448
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:04,770
and was about to return home

449
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:09,070
when Eunuch Xia took a fancy to me.

450
00:26:09,830 --> 00:26:12,550
He forced me to marry his niece,

451
00:26:12,550 --> 00:26:13,790
Xia Yingying.

452
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:16,580
Xia Yingying was a jealous woman.

453
00:26:16,590 --> 00:26:18,510
You know the rest.

454
00:26:21,550 --> 00:26:22,510
Eventually,

455
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:25,900
she forced your mother
out of the Xie Residence.

456
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:30,720
From then on, I wept every day,

457
00:26:31,350 --> 00:26:34,410
and could only
secretly look at this scroll every night

458
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:35,900
to ease my longing for her.

459
00:26:37,350 --> 00:26:38,290
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

460
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:39,760
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

461
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:39,350
The blood...

462
00:26:48,900 --> 00:26:50,480
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

463
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:52,290
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

464
00:26:59,860 --> 00:27:02,480
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

465
00:27:02,500 --> 00:27:06,250
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

466
00:27:06,830 --> 00:27:07,830
It's fine.

467
00:27:10,110 --> 00:27:11,110
For this illness,

468
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:15,960
many people hired doctors for me

469
00:27:16,830 --> 00:27:19,090
but I secretly poured the medicine away.

470
00:27:20,640 --> 00:27:21,970
I don't want to be cured.

471
00:27:25,070 --> 00:27:26,600
I want to keep this illness.

472
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:28,510
It brings me comfort.

473
00:27:30,750 --> 00:27:32,790
My longing became an illness.

474
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:34,730
This is the only connection

475
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:38,200
left by Heaven in my bones

476
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:43,680
that will forever tie me to your mother.

477
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,120
I will take it with me.

478
00:27:56,800 --> 00:28:02,000
[Danyue Pavilion]

479
00:28:22,400 --> 00:28:24,380
[Danyue Pavilion]

480
00:28:22,590 --> 00:28:23,440
My Lady.

481
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:36,480
Baoxian.

482
00:28:39,510 --> 00:28:40,510
I was...

483
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,590
so close...

484
00:28:46,830 --> 00:28:48,310
to killing him just now.

485
00:28:50,750 --> 00:28:52,750
With just a slight lift of my hand,

486
00:28:55,110 --> 00:28:56,840
I could have stabbed this knife

487
00:28:57,510 --> 00:28:59,880
into his heart without hesitation.

488
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:09,240
But I held back.

489
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:21,110
I watched

490
00:29:22,550 --> 00:29:23,880
this hypocrite

491
00:29:24,510 --> 00:29:27,270
play the role of

492
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:31,460
a husband who deeply loved his late wife,

493
00:29:33,550 --> 00:29:35,110
a father who was

494
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:38,740
full of remorse in front of his daughter.

495
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:41,350
Daughter.

496
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:44,550
You know,

497
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:46,790
when I was younger,

498
00:29:47,590 --> 00:29:49,260
I often had this foolish dream.

499
00:29:49,260 --> 00:29:50,320
[Spring comes to Changmen Palace, where the grass turns green.
Red plum buds just beginning to bloom.]

500
00:29:50,270 --> 00:29:53,200
It has to be after a harsh winter,

501
00:29:50,350 --> 00:29:51,460
[Jade-green tea, ground fine as dust.
A sip at dawn breaks a dream and stirs a cup of spring.]

502
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:56,480
when the snow has cleared
and spring has brought clear skies.

503
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:59,030
With a fine steed and an elegant carriage,

504
00:29:59,790 --> 00:30:02,240
I bring your mother back home as my bride.

505
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:04,720
But that very year,

506
00:30:06,110 --> 00:30:07,310
just as spring began,

507
00:30:08,030 --> 00:30:10,030
before the last snow cleared,

508
00:30:10,310 --> 00:30:15,270
I heard that your mother had died
for harboring rebels.

509
00:30:23,110 --> 00:30:24,030
Since then...

510
00:30:28,590 --> 00:30:29,640
Since then,

511
00:30:30,440 --> 00:30:32,240
around the beginning of spring,

512
00:30:32,920 --> 00:30:35,880
I would lock myself away to reflect,

513
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:37,730
refusing to see anyone.

514
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,000
Because...

515
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,880
Because from then on, in this world,

516
00:30:45,590 --> 00:30:46,720
there was no spring.

517
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,480
His act was so convincing,

518
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:54,240
so disgusting.

519
00:30:54,720 --> 00:30:56,850
The only wife I acknowledge in my heart

520
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:58,620
is your mother, Chunqing.

521
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:01,680
You've already done very well.

522
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:05,160
Patience will surely pay off.

523
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,160
Our goal

524
00:31:06,160 --> 00:31:07,640
isn't to let him die so easily,

525
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:08,270
right?

526
00:31:09,350 --> 00:31:11,030
He must pay a higher price.

527
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,120
[Danyue Pavilion]

528
00:31:15,110 --> 00:31:16,680
But I'm in so much pain!

529
00:31:19,590 --> 00:31:21,320
If it weren't for him back then,

530
00:31:21,590 --> 00:31:23,190
how could my mother have died

531
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:24,480
so miserably?

532
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:27,020
Yet I still have to play along with him

533
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:28,310
and put on

534
00:31:28,750 --> 00:31:31,950
this disgusting act
of deep father-daughter affection.

535
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,750
I'm really in so much pain!

536
00:31:34,510 --> 00:31:35,550
From then on,

537
00:31:36,350 --> 00:31:37,920
I wept every day,

538
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:41,700
and could only
secretly look at this scroll every night

539
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:43,180
to ease my longing for her.

540
00:31:45,310 --> 00:31:46,070
His act

541
00:31:47,720 --> 00:31:49,000
just now

542
00:31:49,590 --> 00:31:52,790
made me realize
that no one in this residence is innocent.

543
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:53,590
Father,

544
00:31:55,030 --> 00:31:56,400
was this the first time

545
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:59,000
you fought for a woman?

546
00:32:01,270 --> 00:32:02,070
Of course.

547
00:32:03,440 --> 00:32:04,840
It was also the last time.

548
00:32:05,720 --> 00:32:06,720
The only time.

549
00:32:08,790 --> 00:32:10,790
I will find out everyone

550
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,000
involved in

551
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:16,680
hurting my mother back then.

552
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:21,070
I want them all to receive

553
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:24,400
the punishment they deserve.

554
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:26,350
Alright, we'll find them.

555
00:32:27,350 --> 00:32:28,880
We will find them together.

556
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:30,790
My Lady,

557
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:34,030
you are the bravest

558
00:32:34,310 --> 00:32:36,710
and most incredible daughter in the world.

559
00:32:36,830 --> 00:32:39,000
I think you've done very well.

560
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:42,640
No.

561
00:32:48,510 --> 00:32:49,440
It's not enough.

562
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:52,480
My mother

563
00:32:53,750 --> 00:32:56,310
is still being accused of murder.

564
00:32:58,880 --> 00:32:59,960
The only way

565
00:33:01,720 --> 00:33:04,050
is to find the only witness
from that year,

566
00:33:04,790 --> 00:33:06,390
Cui'er, the medicine slave.

567
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:10,510
Fifth Madam died of the euphorbia,

568
00:33:10,510 --> 00:33:12,110
and Cui'er has gone missing.

569
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:14,570
Where should we start investigating?

570
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,410
There will be a way eventually.

571
00:33:20,070 --> 00:33:21,030
Xie Shu,

572
00:33:23,510 --> 00:33:25,240
I want you to live well

573
00:33:27,920 --> 00:33:29,270
and watch helplessly

574
00:33:32,350 --> 00:33:34,400
as I destroy everything you have,

575
00:33:36,750 --> 00:33:38,270
step by step.

576
00:33:49,510 --> 00:33:50,030
Madam.

577
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,200
Bear with it.

578
00:33:56,200 --> 00:33:57,440
Black hair

579
00:33:57,750 --> 00:33:59,030
turning white.

580
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:01,880
You've been working so hard.

581
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:04,260
It pains my heart to see you like this.

582
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:11,280
I must treasure it.

583
00:34:19,710 --> 00:34:21,070
About Zhengjun...

584
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:22,110
Master,

585
00:34:22,630 --> 00:34:23,840
what is your plan?

586
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:26,840
He caused such trouble.

587
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,190
I'm afraid

588
00:34:29,480 --> 00:34:31,739
it will implicate our entire Xie family.

589
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:34,230
That little brat—

590
00:34:35,630 --> 00:34:37,489
you don't need to worry about him.

591
00:34:38,670 --> 00:34:40,320
But right now,

592
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:42,280
to save the Xie family,

593
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:45,840
we must do as Yan Rui said

594
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:48,290
and testify against Wei Changyan.

595
00:34:48,840 --> 00:34:51,280
But he was

596
00:34:51,280 --> 00:34:52,960
personally trained by our older brother.

597
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:54,360
Given our relationship,

598
00:34:54,710 --> 00:34:57,320
I dare not act ra—

599
00:34:59,320 --> 00:35:00,150
Master.

600
00:35:01,550 --> 00:35:04,150
Since I've married into the Xie family,

601
00:35:04,960 --> 00:35:07,670
I put the Xie family first in everything.

602
00:35:08,110 --> 00:35:11,230
Moreover, my older brother
holds a high position,

603
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:14,760
so he naturally knows
the dangers of officialdom.

604
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:17,000
Now that our Xie family is in trouble,

605
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:20,510
he will surely understand
our difficulties.

606
00:35:22,510 --> 00:35:23,630
I owe him my thanks.

607
00:35:25,480 --> 00:35:26,230
Honey.

608
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:30,920
There's something I find hard to say,

609
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:33,840
but I must tell you.

610
00:35:34,110 --> 00:35:36,030
My return this time

611
00:35:36,030 --> 00:35:38,090
is not for recovering from injuries.

612
00:35:38,230 --> 00:35:39,110
It's because

613
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:44,070
I failed in my supervision
in the Northern Frontier.

614
00:35:44,070 --> 00:35:45,480
The court punished me,

615
00:35:45,630 --> 00:35:47,090
suspended me from my post,

616
00:35:47,550 --> 00:35:48,710
and ordered me back

617
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:52,000
to reflect on my mistakes
behind closed doors.

618
00:35:52,000 --> 00:35:52,920
I am ashamed.

619
00:35:55,190 --> 00:35:58,760
We already knew about this.

620
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:01,760
Good.

621
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:08,510
I'm a fool.

622
00:36:08,670 --> 00:36:10,760
How could anything happening at court

623
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:12,710
escape Brother's notice?

624
00:36:18,190 --> 00:36:19,110
Master...

625
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:21,190
Honey, I understand now.

626
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,800
Before, I couldn't figure out

627
00:36:24,150 --> 00:36:26,840
why His Majesty was lenient with me

628
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:28,510
and gave me a light punishment.

629
00:36:28,510 --> 00:36:29,400
Honey,

630
00:36:29,670 --> 00:36:32,630
did you plead with Brother

631
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:34,060
many times on my behalf

632
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:36,710
after you found out about this?

633
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,840
Please accept my bow.

634
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:43,840
No, no.

635
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:46,440
Honey.

636
00:36:51,190 --> 00:36:52,190
Get up quickly.

637
00:37:01,880 --> 00:37:02,800
Honey.

638
00:37:03,230 --> 00:37:05,150
With a wife like you,

639
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:07,860
what more could a husband ask for?

640
00:37:10,070 --> 00:37:14,760
But now that I've lost my power,

641
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:16,550
that Yan Rui...

642
00:37:17,190 --> 00:37:19,250
He's a close minister to His Majesty.

643
00:37:19,320 --> 00:37:21,400
I can't clash with him head-on.

644
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:24,840
I'm afraid I can't prevail over him.

645
00:37:25,590 --> 00:37:26,510
Jingzhi.

646
00:37:28,030 --> 00:37:30,760
In Mother's letter to you a few days ago,

647
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:32,710
did she mention

648
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:36,590
that Yan Rui seems to have...

649
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:38,700
a special fondness for Qingyuan?

650
00:37:44,230 --> 00:37:45,150
Let me do it.

651
00:37:49,070 --> 00:37:49,920
Master.

652
00:37:50,630 --> 00:37:52,360
A message came from Liuhua Courtyard
saying

653
00:37:52,360 --> 00:37:54,420
Second Madam is asking you to go over.

654
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:56,110
Reject it.

655
00:37:56,590 --> 00:37:57,520
Doesn't she know

656
00:37:57,960 --> 00:38:01,280
that I'm spending the night here
with Madam Hu?

657
00:38:01,590 --> 00:38:03,250
Tell her we can talk tomorrow.

658
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:04,360
Master.

659
00:38:05,030 --> 00:38:06,890
I'm afraid that's not a good idea.

660
00:38:10,440 --> 00:38:11,880
Come inside and report.

661
00:38:15,070 --> 00:38:17,070
What do you mean that's not a good idea?

662
00:38:17,070 --> 00:38:18,470
Second Madam is furious.

663
00:38:18,760 --> 00:38:20,840
She said she would smash up
Liuhua Courtyard.

664
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,100
Is she trying to rebel?

665
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,230
So unruly!

666
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:28,280
Jingzhi.

667
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:30,590
You should go over.

668
00:38:32,070 --> 00:38:33,000
How could I?

669
00:38:33,630 --> 00:38:34,320
No.

670
00:38:36,360 --> 00:38:38,840
You scolded her during the day.

671
00:38:39,760 --> 00:38:40,880
What's more,

672
00:38:41,190 --> 00:38:44,230
her favorite youngest son
is still in prison.

673
00:38:45,550 --> 00:38:46,630
She probably

674
00:38:48,630 --> 00:38:50,920
has a lot she wants to tell you.

675
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,320
She's getting way too bold.

676
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:54,670
Honey,

677
00:38:55,190 --> 00:38:57,150
you are just too lenient.

678
00:38:58,320 --> 00:38:59,550
I regret it.

679
00:39:00,230 --> 00:39:01,150
Honey,

680
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:04,630
I was forced to marry this witch

681
00:39:05,510 --> 00:39:07,230
back then.

682
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:10,260
I had no choice,
and I couldn't say anything.

683
00:39:11,190 --> 00:39:12,110
I understand.

684
00:39:14,670 --> 00:39:15,360
No.

685
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:16,840
This matter

686
00:39:17,150 --> 00:39:18,360
is very important.

687
00:39:19,480 --> 00:39:22,360
I am really afraid this shrew

688
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:24,480
will cause big trouble.

689
00:39:24,800 --> 00:39:26,480
How about this?

690
00:39:26,710 --> 00:39:28,440
I'll go pacify her a bit.

691
00:39:33,230 --> 00:39:35,590
And I'll come see you another day.
